WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:37.980
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:38.250 --> 01:43.870
[Small Town Remedy]

3
01:44.229 --> 01:46.740
[Episode 4]

4
01:47.150 --> 01:48.070
Does it hurt?

5
01:49.920 --> 01:51.920
You're not the doctor from earlier.

6
01:55.310 --> 01:56.120
Oh, it's you.

7
01:56.710 --> 01:57.640
You know me?

8
01:59.789 --> 02:01.430
That day, your brother and I

9
01:59.900 --> 02:02.900
[Emergency]

10
02:01.640 --> 02:03.100
were at the No. 1 Hospital.

11
02:04.310 --> 02:05.280
I remember now.

12
02:05.280 --> 02:06.560
The one who fought with Zhengguang.

13
02:06.560 --> 02:08.160
We were just playing around.

14
02:08.240 --> 02:09.080
Give it to me.

15
02:11.870 --> 02:12.680
Your white blood cell count

16
02:12.680 --> 02:13.710
is normal,

17
02:14.280 --> 02:15.560
but the neutrophil percentage

18
02:15.560 --> 02:16.870
has increased.

19
02:18.030 --> 02:19.310
Platelets are at 50.

20
02:20.710 --> 02:21.870
Come, lie down on the bed back there.

21
02:21.870 --> 02:23.000
I'll examine you.

22
02:23.150 --> 02:23.880
Come on, Mom.

23
02:24.750 --> 02:25.470
Get up.

24
02:26.400 --> 02:27.079
Let's go.

25
02:30.310 --> 02:31.240
If it hurts later,

26
02:31.240 --> 02:31.970
just tell me.

27
02:39.430 --> 02:40.630
It doesn't hurt here.

28
02:44.079 --> 02:45.280
It hurts a lot here.

29
02:46.590 --> 02:47.470
Alright, we're done.

30
02:47.470 --> 02:48.240
Get up.

31
02:48.240 --> 02:49.000
Come on, Mom.

32
02:49.000 --> 02:50.710
You'll have an ultrasound in a bit.

33
02:50.710 --> 02:52.470
Why an ultrasound?

34
02:52.750 --> 02:54.120
Where's the doctor from earlier?

35
02:54.120 --> 02:56.050
He hid because he was afraid of you.

36
02:57.030 --> 02:58.630
Then just give me an IV drip.

37
02:58.630 --> 03:00.310
Anyone can do it, really.

38
03:00.750 --> 03:02.120
I can't give you an IV drip.

39
03:02.120 --> 03:03.310
Our preliminary diagnosis is

40
03:03.310 --> 03:04.560
that you most likely have

41
03:04.560 --> 03:05.680
ureteral stones

42
03:05.800 --> 03:07.630
accompanied by hydronephrosis and infection.

43
03:07.630 --> 03:09.560
So you must do an ultrasound first.

44
03:09.560 --> 03:11.360
We'll diagnose further

45
03:11.430 --> 03:12.120
and then decide

46
03:12.120 --> 03:14.050
on your follow-up treatment plan.

47
03:15.040 --> 03:21.040
[No smoking]

48
03:16.150 --> 03:18.000
You make me do one test first,

49
03:18.870 --> 03:20.750
then trick me into doing another.

50
03:21.120 --> 03:24.660
[Emergency Room 18]

51
03:23.000 --> 03:25.060
You guys are just taking all my money.

52
03:25.960 --> 03:28.120
The money you pay for treatment doesn't go to me.

53
03:28.120 --> 03:29.430
Why would I trick you?

54
03:37.280 --> 03:39.410
Come on, take your mom there right now.

55
03:39.470 --> 03:39.960
She already

56
03:39.960 --> 03:41.120
has chills and a fever.

57
03:41.120 --> 03:42.800
Although her white blood cell count is normal,

58
03:42.800 --> 03:44.079
her neutrophils

59
03:44.079 --> 03:45.750
have clearly changed.

60
03:45.840 --> 03:47.190
Her platelets are so low,

61
03:47.190 --> 03:48.910
she's very likely to have a severe infection

62
03:48.910 --> 03:50.120
and develop sepsis.

63
03:50.430 --> 03:51.840
If delayed for too long,

64
03:51.840 --> 03:53.280
the patient will go into shock

65
03:53.280 --> 03:55.010
and even face the risk of death.

66
03:55.430 --> 03:56.190
Okay.

67
03:56.190 --> 03:56.910
Let's go.

68
03:56.910 --> 03:57.800
Wait,

69
03:58.079 --> 04:00.190
I haven't even agreed to do it yet.

70
04:00.190 --> 04:02.470
Why did you just write the orders for me?

71
04:03.280 --> 04:04.540
What if after the test,

72
04:04.910 --> 04:06.870
I don't have stones?

73
04:07.750 --> 04:08.910
Can I get a refund?

74
04:09.240 --> 04:10.000
No refunds.

75
04:10.000 --> 04:11.400
Then I won't do it.

76
04:12.150 --> 04:14.150
Who knows if you're actually right?

77
04:14.430 --> 04:14.960
Okay.

78
04:15.840 --> 04:16.560
Anyway, I've said

79
04:16.560 --> 04:17.690
what I needed to say.

80
04:17.920 --> 04:19.320
If you don't want to do it,

81
04:19.560 --> 04:21.070
just throw these orders in the trash.

82
04:21.070 --> 04:22.480
We'll do it. We'll do it.

83
04:23.000 --> 04:24.480
Mom, I know this doctor.

84
04:24.480 --> 04:26.270
He came back from a big hospital in the South.

85
04:26.270 --> 04:27.130
He's very good.

86
04:27.360 --> 04:29.070
He specializes in brain surgery.

87
04:29.070 --> 04:30.040
He's an authority.

88
04:30.040 --> 04:31.070
It's fine to do what he says.

89
04:31.070 --> 04:32.400
Let's do an ultrasound.

90
04:33.040 --> 04:34.840
From a big hospital in the South?

91
04:34.950 --> 04:36.040
Then why did he come back?

92
04:36.040 --> 04:38.100
My mom died. I'm here for the funeral.

93
04:38.240 --> 04:39.370
That's not allowed?

94
04:44.070 --> 04:45.360
You've got some nerve.

95
04:47.190 --> 04:48.040
Let's do it.

96
04:48.270 --> 04:49.070
Let's do it.

97
04:49.950 --> 04:50.720
Do it, do it, do it.

98
04:50.720 --> 04:51.360
Okay.

99
04:52.720 --> 04:54.380
Thank you, doctor. Thank you.

100
05:01.610 --> 05:04.390
[Emergency]

101
05:02.830 --> 05:03.890
Does it still hurt?

102
05:04.000 --> 05:04.830
It's okay.

103
05:04.420 --> 05:05.940
[Quiet]

104
05:04.830 --> 05:06.360
It hurts in waves.

105
05:06.580 --> 05:10.070
[Quiet] [Red zone]

106
05:07.750 --> 05:08.830
It's so annoying.

107
05:09.070 --> 05:10.270
We have to cooperate.

108
05:11.270 --> 05:12.070
Come on.

109
05:17.610 --> 05:21.730
[Xiaoximen Hospital Ultrasonic Examination Report]

110
05:18.560 --> 05:19.680
This stone of yours

111
05:19.680 --> 05:21.830
is blocking the lower part of your right ureter.

112
05:21.830 --> 05:23.090
It's 1.8 centimeters.

113
05:23.920 --> 05:25.430
And your right kidney

114
05:25.750 --> 05:27.410
has obvious hydronephrosis.

115
05:28.750 --> 05:29.720
Is it serious?

116
05:30.310 --> 05:32.000
When I felt uncomfortable before,

117
05:31.830 --> 05:35.659
[Chest Pain and Stroke]

118
05:32.000 --> 05:34.600
I used my cupped hands to pat my lower back,

119
05:34.830 --> 05:36.159
and it felt much better.

120
05:36.600 --> 05:37.510
Good palm strength.

121
05:37.510 --> 05:39.750
You patted the stone right into the ureter.

122
05:39.750 --> 05:40.190
Alright.

123
05:40.190 --> 05:41.770
You can go to the urology department now.

124
05:41.770 --> 05:48.970
[Chest Pain and Stroke]

125
05:42.190 --> 05:42.600
Okay.

126
05:42.600 --> 05:44.240
I spent money here,

127
05:44.680 --> 05:45.560
and you're sending me

128
05:45.560 --> 05:46.830
somewhere else.

129
05:47.000 --> 05:48.630
Didn't I waste my money?

130
05:48.630 --> 05:50.310
I'm only responsible for the diagnosis.

131
05:50.310 --> 05:51.480
The specific treatment

132
05:51.480 --> 05:53.000
has to be done by a specialist doctor.

133
05:53.000 --> 05:54.060
-Yeah. -Whatever.

134
05:54.510 --> 05:55.430
I came to you,

135
05:55.600 --> 05:58.130
so you have to be responsible for me to the end.

136
05:58.630 --> 05:59.480
That can't be done here.

137
05:59.480 --> 06:01.080
Then I'll complain about you

138
06:03.360 --> 06:04.820
and make you lose your job.

139
06:05.480 --> 06:06.600
I know

140
06:06.600 --> 06:08.070
President Long here.

141
06:08.070 --> 06:09.160
That's great!

142
06:09.750 --> 06:10.920
You go right now

143
06:10.920 --> 06:12.780
and have him fire me immediately.

144
06:30.560 --> 06:31.160
Come on.

145
06:31.360 --> 06:32.040
Take your mom immediately

146
06:32.040 --> 06:32.950
to the urology department to find a doctor.

147
06:32.950 --> 06:35.360
-Okay. -Get the admission procedures handled.

148
06:35.360 --> 06:36.159
Don't worry.

149
06:36.159 --> 06:37.890
It won't delay your complaint.

150
06:40.159 --> 06:41.690
Came back from the South...

151
06:42.510 --> 06:44.630
So doctors who came back from big hospitals in the South

152
06:44.630 --> 06:46.270
talk tougher

153
06:46.270 --> 06:47.530
than the doctors here.

154
06:50.430 --> 06:52.270
Let's go get you admitted first.

155
06:55.000 --> 06:55.750
Doctor.

156
06:57.680 --> 07:00.210
You came back from a big hospital in the South,

157
07:00.920 --> 07:02.510
so you must have graduated

158
07:02.510 --> 07:04.270
from a prestigious university, right?

159
07:04.270 --> 07:06.070
You must be very educated.

160
07:07.070 --> 07:07.750
Come on.

161
07:08.560 --> 07:10.190
Help me take a look at this.

162
07:11.950 --> 07:13.190
This draft...

163
07:13.190 --> 07:15.040
Can you help me polish it?

164
07:15.870 --> 07:17.000
Thank you.

165
07:20.600 --> 07:22.400
Sorry to trouble you. Thank you.

166
07:27.030 --> 07:27.500
[Fighting for justice]

167
07:27.520 --> 07:27.890
[Li Changlu, former director of the former Fucheng Paper Mill, is utterly heartless]

168
07:27.920 --> 07:28.300
[He sold the paper factory at a low price and embezzled national assets]

169
07:28.330 --> 07:29.080
[Causing more than 100 workers to lose their jobs]

170
07:29.100 --> 07:29.840
[They've been defending their rights for 25 years]

171
07:29.840 --> 07:30.580
[But the matter still has no proper resolution]

172
07:30.600 --> 07:31.700
[And Li Changlu ran away with the money]

173
07:31.720 --> 07:32.980
[Duan Yinghua, former workshop director of the paper mill]

174
07:47.070 --> 07:49.710
[Xiaoximen Hospital]

175
07:47.630 --> 07:48.120
Bro.

176
08:06.240 --> 08:07.920
Crappy place, crappy hospital, crappy door!

177
08:07.920 --> 08:09.750
Damn it, what the hell?

178
08:10.120 --> 08:11.050
What is he doing?

179
08:12.240 --> 08:14.630
What's going on? What did he say?

180
08:15.600 --> 08:17.060
Histrionic personality.

181
08:17.390 --> 08:18.310
Just like you.

182
08:19.480 --> 08:20.430
Screw off!

183
08:32.110 --> 08:32.870
Hello.

184
08:33.669 --> 08:35.750
How does it feel to just start working?

185
08:34.130 --> 08:37.820
[Xiaoximen Hospital]

186
08:38.240 --> 08:39.120
Weirdos.

187
08:39.200 --> 08:39.960
Weirdos?

188
08:40.270 --> 08:42.789
Are you talking about the patients or the doctors?

189
08:42.789 --> 08:44.320
Bro, you're scheduled for the night shift tomorrow.

190
08:44.320 --> 08:45.720
Don't forget, 4 o'clock.

191
08:47.670 --> 08:48.870
They're all weirdos.

192
08:49.200 --> 08:50.510
I've never seen a hospital like this.

193
08:50.510 --> 08:52.370
If it weren't for President Long,

194
08:53.080 --> 08:54.750
this hospital would have been shut down long ago.

195
08:54.750 --> 08:56.080
It's just a matter of time.

196
08:56.080 --> 08:57.810
There are hardly any patients.

197
08:58.360 --> 08:59.870
That's right.

198
09:00.630 --> 09:02.440
This hospital is closest to the crematorium.

199
09:02.440 --> 09:02.910
Look,

200
09:02.910 --> 09:05.200
it's in the suburbs and the medical conditions are poor.

201
09:05.200 --> 09:05.960
Isn't there

202
09:05.960 --> 09:07.390
a rhyme like this?

203
09:07.630 --> 09:09.510
Xiaoximen Hospital faces west,

204
09:10.240 --> 09:12.320
a fast track to heaven.

205
09:12.630 --> 09:15.030
Who in their right mind would go to heaven to see a doctor?

206
09:15.030 --> 09:15.830
Can you not go?

207
09:16.030 --> 09:17.230
What do you want to do?

208
09:17.550 --> 09:18.870
Is there anything wrong with me wanting to make money?

209
09:18.870 --> 09:19.630
I don't want to spend my whole life

210
09:19.630 --> 09:20.790
being a loser here, is that wrong?

211
09:20.790 --> 09:22.030
What's wrong with our place?

212
09:22.030 --> 09:22.750
The doctor from the big city

213
09:22.750 --> 09:24.150
came back too, didn't he?

214
09:24.240 --> 09:25.510
That's because he couldn't compete with the better ones,

215
09:25.510 --> 09:26.150
isn't it?

216
09:26.150 --> 09:26.750
Step aside!

217
09:26.750 --> 09:28.120
You'll make money off anything, huh?

218
09:28.120 --> 09:28.720
What's wrong with that?

219
09:28.720 --> 09:30.870
What the hell kind of doctors are in this hospital?

220
09:30.870 --> 09:32.200
They're all incompetent,

221
09:32.200 --> 09:33.400
just coasting along.

222
09:34.150 --> 09:35.840
Isn't it responsible for its own profits and losses?

223
09:35.840 --> 09:37.390
It hasn't lost enough yet.

224
09:40.120 --> 09:42.000
Then I hope it goes bankrupt tomorrow.

225
09:42.000 --> 09:43.840
How's that lying flat and doing nothing method

226
09:43.840 --> 09:45.240
I taught you working out?

227
09:45.440 --> 09:46.750
Don't mention it. I used it,

228
09:46.750 --> 09:47.810
but it didn't work.

229
09:48.000 --> 09:50.130
Then you're not lying flat enough yet.

230
09:50.550 --> 09:51.630
What do you mean not flat enough?

231
09:51.630 --> 09:52.390
I lie flat,

232
09:52.390 --> 09:54.030
but they lie even flatter than me.

233
09:54.030 --> 09:55.080
If I'm the Sanjiang Plain,

234
09:54.870 --> 09:59.940
[Entrance]

235
09:55.080 --> 09:56.600
they're the Qaidam Basin.

236
09:56.670 --> 09:57.720
The method you taught me

237
09:57.720 --> 09:58.870
almost made me blend in with them

238
09:58.870 --> 10:00.360
as fast as possible, you know?

239
10:00.360 --> 10:02.510
What a crappy method. Stop messing around.

240
10:02.510 --> 10:04.120
Qaidam Basin, huh?

241
10:04.390 --> 10:04.960
Tell me,

242
10:04.960 --> 10:06.890
how much of a basin have you become?

243
10:11.960 --> 10:12.630
What are you doing?

244
10:12.630 --> 10:13.320
No.

245
10:13.320 --> 10:13.550
Security.

246
10:13.550 --> 10:14.790
What are you doing?

247
10:14.790 --> 10:15.670
Didn't I tell you

248
10:15.670 --> 10:17.000
Dr. Liu is off work?

249
10:17.000 --> 10:18.720
See for yourself.

250
10:19.270 --> 10:19.910
She...

251
10:21.670 --> 10:23.330
What's going on with you guys?

252
10:23.480 --> 10:25.120
You told me to go to the urology department, right?

253
10:25.120 --> 10:26.150
Urology won't treat her,

254
10:26.150 --> 10:27.150
so who else am I supposed to turn to?

255
10:27.150 --> 10:28.360
Why won't they treat you?

256
10:28.360 --> 10:29.750
He said he didn't dare to treat it.

257
10:29.750 --> 10:31.550
What kind of thing is that to say?

258
10:31.870 --> 10:33.270
Put me through to urology.

259
10:33.270 --> 10:33.910
I'm looking for the doctor

260
10:33.910 --> 10:35.840
who was treating Ms. Duan earlier.

261
10:36.440 --> 10:37.200
Dr. Liu.

262
10:40.080 --> 10:40.630
Hello.

263
10:41.600 --> 10:43.030
This is Liu Zhengliang from the emergency surgery department.

264
10:43.030 --> 10:44.030
I want to know

265
10:44.030 --> 10:44.630
why didn't you

266
10:44.630 --> 10:46.150
operate on Ms. Duan?

267
10:46.550 --> 10:47.790
The patient has a co-infection.

268
10:47.790 --> 10:49.550
It's that serious. How are we supposed to operate?

269
10:49.550 --> 10:51.030
You can insert a ureteral stent to drain it.

270
10:51.030 --> 10:52.440
Our director left for a job

271
10:52.440 --> 10:53.840
at a hospital down south.

272
10:54.240 --> 10:55.360
Don't you have any other doctors here

273
10:55.360 --> 10:56.120
who can perform the procedure?

274
10:56.120 --> 10:57.600
I don't have the skills.

275
10:57.960 --> 10:59.720
The others are even less qualified than I am.

276
10:59.720 --> 11:01.720
If her infection worsens

277
11:02.030 --> 11:03.840
during the operation,

278
11:04.200 --> 11:05.240
causing an accident,

279
11:05.240 --> 11:06.360
I can't take responsibility for that.

280
11:06.360 --> 11:07.240
If she

281
11:07.240 --> 11:08.300
isn't treated now,

282
11:08.360 --> 11:09.910
her infection will get worse and worse.

283
11:09.910 --> 11:11.080
If she develops

284
11:11.080 --> 11:12.000
septic shock later,

285
11:12.000 --> 11:13.320
the mortality rate is very high.

286
11:13.320 --> 11:15.120
I've told the old lady.

287
11:15.120 --> 11:15.790
You'd better

288
11:15.790 --> 11:17.390
go to a higher-level hospital.

289
11:17.390 --> 11:18.240
You know what?

290
11:18.390 --> 11:19.080
Her son

291
11:19.080 --> 11:20.080
almost grabbed me by the collar

292
11:20.080 --> 11:21.150
and beat me up.

293
11:21.200 --> 11:23.200
This mother and son are too unreasonable.

294
11:23.200 --> 11:23.840
Look,

295
11:23.840 --> 11:25.840
if things get out of hand, just call security.

296
11:25.840 --> 11:26.840
Our security guard, Li,

297
11:26.840 --> 11:27.600
has trained in

298
11:27.600 --> 11:29.460
Tiger and Leopard-style kung fu.

299
11:31.390 --> 11:32.270
What did he say?

300
11:35.360 --> 11:35.960
Mom.

301
11:35.960 --> 11:36.480
Auntie,

302
11:36.480 --> 11:37.390
the doctor in the urology department

303
11:37.390 --> 11:38.320
didn't lie to you.

304
11:38.320 --> 11:39.360
Your infection is very serious.

305
11:39.360 --> 11:40.360
You need surgery.

306
11:40.630 --> 11:41.830
I won't have surgery.

307
11:42.270 --> 11:44.550
I have a lot of things to do.

308
11:44.550 --> 11:46.950
-I don't have time. -What are you busy with?

309
11:48.840 --> 11:49.750
The big character poster...

310
11:49.160 --> 11:53.830
[Patient Satisfaction Survey]

311
11:49.750 --> 11:50.600
Look,

312
11:51.390 --> 11:52.870
all the idioms on this poster are wrong.

313
11:52.870 --> 11:54.270
No one can understand it.

314
11:56.670 --> 11:59.030
I was wondering why no one paid attention to me.

315
11:58.950 --> 12:00.140
[Li Changlu sold the paper mill for a fraction of its value and embezzled state assets]

316
11:59.960 --> 12:01.790
It turns out it was written incorrectly.

317
12:00.170 --> 12:00.970
[leaving over 100 workers out of a job.]

318
12:01.000 --> 12:01.970
[25 years of fighting for justice, and still no resolution.]

319
12:02.000 --> 12:02.830
[Meanwhile, Li Changlu fled with the money.]

320
12:04.000 --> 12:05.670
After so many years,

321
12:07.510 --> 12:09.000
this is the first time

322
12:09.360 --> 12:11.960
anyone's paid attention to what I've written.

323
12:12.840 --> 12:13.790
Let me tell you,

324
12:13.910 --> 12:15.630
your mother's infection is very serious.

325
12:15.630 --> 12:17.320
She needs surgery as soon as possible.

326
12:17.320 --> 12:19.000
But the urologist here

327
12:19.000 --> 12:19.870
doesn't feel confident treating it.

328
12:19.870 --> 12:21.320
-Where can she get treatment? -I suggest you

329
12:21.320 --> 12:22.670
go to a higher-level hospital.

330
12:22.670 --> 12:23.910
I don't have money.

331
12:24.240 --> 12:25.240
To be honest,

332
12:26.270 --> 12:26.960
I don't want

333
12:26.960 --> 12:29.000
to spend so much money on medical treatment.

334
12:29.000 --> 12:30.720
Come on, you keep saying no to everything.

335
12:30.720 --> 12:32.360
This was originally a minor problem.

336
12:32.360 --> 12:33.600
If you put it off for three to five days,

337
12:33.600 --> 12:34.240
it could cost you your life.

338
12:34.240 --> 12:35.440
So be it.

339
12:36.080 --> 12:37.200
In this life,

340
12:38.790 --> 12:41.270
I've encountered too many terrible things.

341
12:42.960 --> 12:44.150
I've had enough of life.

342
12:44.150 --> 12:44.960
Mom.

343
12:48.510 --> 12:49.320
Dr. Liu.

344
12:50.120 --> 12:51.550
I can tell

345
12:52.200 --> 12:53.750
you're blunt,

346
12:54.320 --> 12:56.000
but you've got a good heart.

347
12:59.200 --> 13:02.720
I was just speaking out of anger.

348
13:03.200 --> 13:06.750
If I can stay alive, why would I want to die?

349
13:08.510 --> 13:09.790
But I only have

350
13:09.790 --> 13:11.600
1000 yuan in my pocket.

351
13:12.150 --> 13:13.550
Please help me

352
13:14.080 --> 13:16.320
find a cheaper way to get treated.

353
13:16.320 --> 13:17.120
A thousand?

354
13:18.080 --> 13:19.870
I'm putting my life

355
13:19.870 --> 13:21.600
in your hands.

356
13:21.600 --> 13:22.750
I'm begging you.

357
13:22.750 --> 13:23.670
I'm really begging you.

358
13:23.670 --> 13:24.030
Don't...

359
13:24.030 --> 13:25.600
-Mom, what are you doing? -Don't do this.

360
13:25.600 --> 13:26.960
This is emotional blackmail.

361
13:26.960 --> 13:28.030
Dr. Liu,

362
13:28.030 --> 13:29.870
how's your first day of work?

363
13:30.390 --> 13:31.600
Long.

364
13:34.390 --> 13:35.670
Director Duan is here.

365
13:35.960 --> 13:37.120
I'm going to die.

366
13:37.630 --> 13:39.480
I won't bother you anymore.

367
13:42.910 --> 13:44.480
I can't handle this person.

368
13:44.190 --> 13:50.090
[Clean Area]

369
13:44.870 --> 13:46.200
Get someone else to take over.

370
13:46.200 --> 13:47.080
If you can't handle her,

371
13:47.080 --> 13:48.550
why did you talk to her about the big-character poster?

372
13:48.550 --> 13:50.030
I have OCD.

373
13:50.120 --> 13:51.850
I can't stand seeing mistakes.

374
13:53.120 --> 13:54.360
She's clinging to you now.

375
13:54.360 --> 13:56.220
There's nothing I can do about it.

376
13:58.600 --> 13:59.910
Anyway, if you ask me,

377
14:00.720 --> 14:01.720
she needs surgery

378
14:02.150 --> 14:03.790
and needs to go to a bigger hospital.

379
14:03.790 --> 14:05.630
Why go to a higher-level hospital?

380
14:05.630 --> 14:07.760
I know someone at Xiaoximen Hospital.

381
14:09.360 --> 14:10.080
Okay.

382
14:10.840 --> 14:12.370
As long as you know someone.

383
14:13.240 --> 14:13.840
Hey.

384
14:13.760 --> 14:16.840
[Clean Area]

385
14:14.120 --> 14:16.320
Do you think this surgery is difficult?

386
14:23.250 --> 14:29.150
[Wound Debridement Room] [Allergies]

387
14:34.720 --> 14:35.870
The patient's stone

388
14:36.270 --> 14:38.790
is currently stuck in the right ureter,

389
14:39.630 --> 14:40.720
right about here.

390
14:43.000 --> 14:45.600
The urine is backing up above the obstruction.

391
14:45.630 --> 14:46.630
There is already

392
14:46.630 --> 14:47.790
a co-infection.

393
14:47.960 --> 14:48.870
If we don't immediately

394
14:48.870 --> 14:49.790
drain the fluid

395
14:49.530 --> 14:54.880
[Supply Room]

396
14:49.790 --> 14:50.870
from above,

397
14:51.960 --> 14:53.870
bacteria will continuously

398
14:53.870 --> 14:55.080
enter the bloodstream,

399
14:55.080 --> 14:56.840
which can easily cause sepsis

400
14:56.840 --> 14:59.080
or even septic shock.

401
14:59.720 --> 15:00.550
Considering

402
15:00.550 --> 15:02.550
the patient's current financial situation,

403
15:02.550 --> 15:03.790
the optimal plan

404
15:03.910 --> 15:07.390
is to place a ureteral stent to relieve the obstruction and drain the urine.

405
15:07.390 --> 15:08.720
What does that involve?

406
15:09.360 --> 15:10.420
Walk me through it.

407
15:13.240 --> 15:15.700
After the ureteroscope enters the bladder,

408
15:16.070 --> 15:17.670
we find the ureteral orifice

409
15:18.030 --> 15:19.550
insert a guidewire

410
15:20.030 --> 15:22.440
through the narrow space

411
15:22.440 --> 15:23.640
alongside the stone.

412
15:23.910 --> 15:26.080
Finally, we pass a stent

413
15:26.320 --> 15:27.550
over the guidewire

414
15:27.550 --> 15:29.080
and into the ureter.

415
15:32.840 --> 15:33.750
It's like

416
15:33.750 --> 15:35.080
a big rock blocking

417
15:35.240 --> 15:37.000
a road we normally take.

418
15:37.200 --> 15:39.120
We need to find a way

419
15:39.120 --> 15:40.550
around the rock to make a path

420
15:40.550 --> 15:42.390
to drain the fluid inside.

421
15:43.360 --> 15:44.080
That's it.

422
15:45.360 --> 15:46.080
This kind of surgery

423
15:46.080 --> 15:48.740
is usually performed under spinal anesthesia.

424
15:48.840 --> 15:50.840
The patient's platelet count is low,

425
15:50.840 --> 15:52.390
so spinal anesthesia could be risky.

426
15:52.390 --> 15:53.840
We'll have to use general anesthesia.

427
15:53.840 --> 15:54.640
You know that.

428
15:56.270 --> 15:57.910
I understand once you elaborate.

429
15:57.910 --> 15:59.200
But the problem now is,

430
15:59.320 --> 16:01.390
general anesthesia alone costs over 3,000.

431
16:01.390 --> 16:02.440
You go tell her.

432
16:02.870 --> 16:04.720
It doesn't matter who tells her about it.

433
16:04.720 --> 16:06.000
The condition itself isn't hard to treat.

434
16:06.000 --> 16:07.200
The real problem is that she can't afford it.

435
16:07.200 --> 16:08.150
Not even 3,000?

436
16:08.150 --> 16:08.720
Yes.

437
16:09.200 --> 16:10.440
She'd rather wait to die at home

438
16:10.440 --> 16:12.480
than spend so much money on treatment.

439
16:12.480 --> 16:13.600
I can't believe anyone

440
16:13.600 --> 16:14.440
would put that little money

441
16:14.440 --> 16:15.910
ahead of their own life.

442
16:16.070 --> 16:17.390
You don't understand because you haven't been poor.

443
16:17.390 --> 16:18.270
Have you ever been poor?

444
16:18.270 --> 16:19.510
Who says I haven't been poor?

445
16:19.510 --> 16:20.630
I'm even worse off than she is right now.

446
16:20.630 --> 16:21.630
All my belongings combined

447
16:21.630 --> 16:22.630
are only worth about a thousand.

448
16:22.630 --> 16:24.030
You're young. You have time,

449
16:24.030 --> 16:25.670
skills, and knowledge.

450
16:25.670 --> 16:27.200
In that sense, you're rich.

451
16:27.360 --> 16:28.630
Being poor isn't just about

452
16:28.630 --> 16:30.560
how much money you have in the bank.

453
16:36.080 --> 16:36.670
Is there

454
16:36.670 --> 16:38.070
a more money-saving way?

455
16:42.600 --> 16:44.270
No. Find someone else.

456
16:45.790 --> 16:47.480
I thought you actually had some skills,

457
16:47.480 --> 16:48.630
some way to fix this.

458
16:51.390 --> 16:52.750
Of course I have a way.

459
16:53.000 --> 16:54.150
I'm just afraid

460
16:54.320 --> 16:55.840
that doctor wouldn't dare to use it.

461
16:55.840 --> 16:57.000
I have a way, too.

462
16:57.000 --> 16:57.840
I'm just afraid that doctor

463
16:57.840 --> 16:59.100
wouldn't dare to do it.

464
17:05.440 --> 17:06.960
Topical anesthesia.

465
17:09.440 --> 17:11.880
This really depends on the doctor's feel for the procedure.

466
17:11.880 --> 17:12.790
And the surgery

467
17:12.790 --> 17:14.250
also has a risk of failure.

468
17:15.349 --> 17:16.069
How about this.

469
17:16.069 --> 17:17.240
I'll call the OR

470
17:17.640 --> 17:18.790
and have them prepare

471
17:18.790 --> 17:20.119
a tube of lidocaine gel.

472
17:20.270 --> 17:21.730
I'll leave the rest to you.

473
17:21.750 --> 17:23.000
Why leave it to me?

474
17:23.440 --> 17:24.790
Don't you know a doctor at Xiaoximen Hospital?

475
17:24.790 --> 17:26.480
Weren't you a doctor at Xiaoximen Hospital?

476
17:26.480 --> 17:28.400
Can you stop scheming against me?

477
17:28.680 --> 17:30.240
I came prepared this time.

478
17:30.790 --> 17:32.400
I looked into your background.

479
17:32.400 --> 17:34.110
You used to work in urology.

480
17:34.110 --> 17:35.830
The patient's condition is critical now.

481
17:35.830 --> 17:37.960
I'll have the hospital's on-call medical administrator

482
17:37.960 --> 17:40.220
authorize you to perform the procedure.

483
17:45.310 --> 17:47.880
Is Duan your friend?

484
17:50.000 --> 17:51.510
If the surgery is successful,

485
17:51.510 --> 17:52.480
can you let me go?

486
17:54.590 --> 17:56.120
First, she's not my friend.

487
17:56.200 --> 17:57.400
She's just a patient.

488
17:57.590 --> 17:58.240
Second,

489
17:58.270 --> 18:00.200
don't use a patient's care as a bargaining chip next time,

490
18:00.200 --> 18:01.400
or I'll beat your ass.

491
18:06.360 --> 18:09.010
[Surgery in Progress]

492
18:12.200 --> 18:14.200
Can I see Dr. Liu

493
18:14.880 --> 18:17.270
during the surgery later?

494
18:17.270 --> 18:18.350
He's here, Auntie.

495
18:18.750 --> 18:19.640
Dr. Liu is here.

496
18:19.640 --> 18:20.640
Let me adjust it for you.

497
18:20.640 --> 18:21.750
Take a look.

498
18:22.270 --> 18:23.550
Can you see him from here?

499
18:23.550 --> 18:26.240
I can't see. It's blurry.

500
18:26.240 --> 18:27.160
I'm right here.

501
18:27.880 --> 18:29.480
Don't worry. Don't be nervous.

502
18:29.480 --> 18:30.480
During the surgery,

503
18:30.480 --> 18:31.750
if you have any problems

504
18:31.750 --> 18:33.000
or feel any discomfort,

505
18:33.000 --> 18:34.030
tell me directly.

506
18:36.110 --> 18:37.510
Just knowing you're here

507
18:38.550 --> 18:41.790
puts my mind at ease.

508
18:42.960 --> 18:44.560
The surgery will start soon.

509
18:44.590 --> 18:45.590
Don't be nervous.

510
18:56.960 --> 18:58.400
Found the ureteral orifice.

511
18:58.400 --> 18:59.060
Guidewire.

512
19:08.920 --> 19:10.550
The guidewire has passed the stone.

513
19:10.550 --> 19:11.720
Open the stent tube.

514
19:11.720 --> 19:12.400
Okay.

515
19:18.200 --> 19:20.800
Let me briefly walk you through the procedure.

516
19:23.350 --> 19:24.270
The simplest

517
19:24.270 --> 19:25.510
and cheapest method

518
19:25.510 --> 19:27.400
is topical anesthesia

519
19:27.400 --> 19:28.800
under local anesthesia.

520
19:30.070 --> 19:31.440
This surgery really

521
19:31.750 --> 19:33.810
depends on the surgeon's feel for it.

522
19:34.350 --> 19:37.210
So there's still some risk involved in the surgery.

523
19:37.480 --> 19:38.160
It's fine.

524
19:38.160 --> 19:39.820
My mom and I both trust Dr. Liu.

525
19:43.030 --> 19:44.110
Even with this

526
19:44.110 --> 19:45.440
simplest approach,

527
19:45.960 --> 19:48.020
1,000 yuan is definitely not enough.

528
19:48.480 --> 19:50.070
The anesthetic costs a dozen yuan.

529
19:50.070 --> 19:52.720
With the procedure, post-op monitoring, and hospital stay,

530
19:52.720 --> 19:54.550
she'll need at least five days in the hospital.

531
19:54.550 --> 19:55.400
I think

532
19:55.960 --> 19:57.420
it'll cost at least 5,000.

533
19:57.720 --> 19:58.750
Dabao, we're at the hospital.

534
19:58.750 --> 20:00.030
Come in.

535
20:00.030 --> 20:00.960
Come in.

536
20:00.960 --> 20:01.720
Come in.

537
20:02.590 --> 20:03.440
Don't stop me.

538
20:03.440 --> 20:04.310
I'm looking for a doctor.

539
20:04.310 --> 20:05.200
Doctor!

540
20:05.200 --> 20:05.730
Don't...

541
20:06.000 --> 20:06.680
Don't stop me.

542
20:06.680 --> 20:07.720
Why are you stopping me?

543
20:07.720 --> 20:09.030
No livestock allowed inside.

544
20:09.030 --> 20:10.110
No livestock allowed inside.

545
20:10.110 --> 20:10.960
No, this is...

546
20:12.400 --> 20:14.070
This is not livestock.

547
20:14.070 --> 20:14.960
It's a pet.

548
20:16.200 --> 20:17.480
My granddaughter doesn't want to keep it anymore,

549
20:17.480 --> 20:19.240
so she left it with me.

550
20:19.480 --> 20:20.400
Jia.

551
20:20.400 --> 20:21.070
Jia, come here.

552
20:21.070 --> 20:22.030
Help me get it out of here.

553
20:22.030 --> 20:22.830
Where is he?

554
20:23.960 --> 20:26.110
Just take a look.

555
20:26.110 --> 20:27.440
Look, it keeps spitting.

556
20:27.440 --> 20:29.110
How much effort could it take?

557
20:30.590 --> 20:32.310
Why are you so hardheaded?

558
20:32.310 --> 20:33.590
It's livestock.

559
20:33.920 --> 20:35.200
Go to a veterinary hospital.

560
20:35.200 --> 20:36.350
Didn't I tell you?

561
20:36.350 --> 20:37.920
This is not livestock. It's a pet.

562
20:37.920 --> 20:38.720
A pet?

563
20:38.720 --> 20:40.120
Then go to a pet hospital.

564
20:40.200 --> 20:41.400
I did.

565
20:41.480 --> 20:42.480
But they said

566
20:42.480 --> 20:43.830
they've never treated anything like this before.

567
20:43.830 --> 20:44.350
Come on,

568
20:44.350 --> 20:45.550
you've got nothing else to do.

569
20:45.550 --> 20:46.480
Just take a look at it.

570
20:46.480 --> 20:47.350
No.

571
20:47.350 --> 20:49.030
Look, it's spitting again.

572
20:49.030 --> 20:50.350
Is it sick?

573
20:50.350 --> 20:51.720
Sick?

574
20:51.720 --> 20:53.680
Sir, this...

575
20:53.680 --> 20:54.790
I-It spits at people.

576
20:54.790 --> 20:55.880
That's...

577
20:55.880 --> 20:57.550
a normal reaction for it.

578
20:57.550 --> 20:59.270
It spits when it's scared

579
20:59.270 --> 20:59.960
or angry.

580
20:59.960 --> 21:01.000
It's not sick.

581
21:01.200 --> 21:01.960
Is it really not sick?

582
21:01.960 --> 21:02.590
Nothing wrong.

583
21:02.590 --> 21:03.680
Nothing wrong at all.

584
21:03.680 --> 21:04.790
Absolutely nothing wrong.

585
21:04.790 --> 21:05.480
That's good.

586
21:05.480 --> 21:06.640
Look, I told you,

587
21:06.640 --> 21:08.440
you can treat both humans and animals,

588
21:08.440 --> 21:09.000
right?

589
21:09.510 --> 21:10.550
Wasting so much time.

590
21:10.550 --> 21:10.790
Thank you.

591
21:10.790 --> 21:11.350
Alright.

592
21:11.350 --> 21:11.880
Hurry up and go.

593
21:11.880 --> 21:12.310
I'm leaving.

594
21:12.310 --> 21:13.030
You take it back

595
21:13.030 --> 21:15.160
and let it get used to the environment.

596
21:15.350 --> 21:16.270
Let's go.

597
21:16.440 --> 21:17.200
Let's go.

598
21:17.200 --> 21:18.680
Let's go home.

599
21:19.610 --> 21:27.420
[Emergency]

600
21:22.480 --> 21:23.070
Granddaughter.

601
21:23.070 --> 21:24.270
I have good news for you.

602
21:24.270 --> 21:25.550
Dabao is fine.

603
21:26.440 --> 21:27.270
It's not sick at all.

604
21:27.270 --> 21:28.310
Don't worry.

605
21:28.550 --> 21:29.310
While you're in Shanghai,

606
21:29.310 --> 21:30.550
work hard and focus on your job.

607
21:30.550 --> 21:32.310
Don't worry about things at home.

608
21:32.310 --> 21:33.400
I'm here to look after Dabao.

609
21:33.400 --> 21:34.790
I know you're busy with work and don't have time to take care of it.

610
21:34.790 --> 21:35.350
But don't worry,

611
21:35.350 --> 21:37.150
I'll take good care of it for you.

612
21:37.160 --> 21:37.690
Hurry up.

613
21:38.350 --> 21:39.550
Let's go home.

614
21:43.160 --> 21:44.620
The surgery was a success.

615
21:56.240 --> 21:57.750
Dr. Liu, Dr. Liu.

616
21:58.480 --> 21:59.310
Thank you so much.

617
21:59.310 --> 22:00.770
My mom is out of danger now.

618
22:01.000 --> 22:01.960
Thank you.

619
22:01.960 --> 22:02.640
I wasn't sure

620
22:02.640 --> 22:03.920
what to get you.

621
22:04.070 --> 22:04.960
Well,

622
22:04.960 --> 22:06.350
here, have this.

623
22:06.350 --> 22:07.350
What is it?

624
22:07.880 --> 22:08.590
Roasted sweet potato.

625
22:08.590 --> 22:09.790
It's freshly roasted and really sweet.

626
22:09.790 --> 22:11.030
Roasted sweet potato?

627
22:11.030 --> 22:11.560
It's hot.

628
22:13.070 --> 22:14.000
Great.

629
22:14.000 --> 22:15.830
I've been constipated these past few days.

630
22:15.830 --> 22:16.880
Hospital policy says

631
22:16.880 --> 22:18.480
we can't accept gifts from patients.

632
22:18.480 --> 22:19.880
It's hardly a gift.

633
22:19.920 --> 22:22.050
It's just a sweet potato for you to eat.

634
22:22.110 --> 22:23.240
I'll take it for him.

635
22:23.960 --> 22:26.160
Our hospital doesn't have that policy.

636
22:26.880 --> 22:28.240
Take good care of your mom.

637
22:28.240 --> 22:29.970
She can eat and drink normally.

638
22:30.240 --> 22:31.070
If she gets a fever,

639
22:31.070 --> 22:32.400
call a nurse right away.

640
22:32.750 --> 22:33.750
Tonight, I'll have Dr. Liu

641
22:33.750 --> 22:35.750
work overtime and keep an eye on her.

642
22:36.400 --> 22:37.720
That's wonderful. Thank you so much.

643
22:37.720 --> 22:38.640
Okay, okay!

644
22:38.640 --> 22:39.550
I won't keep you any longer.

645
22:39.550 --> 22:40.510
I'll go check on my mom.

646
22:40.510 --> 22:41.960
Bye-bye, Dr. Liu. See you tonight.

647
22:41.960 --> 22:43.490
Who said I'd work overtime?

648
22:43.590 --> 22:44.990
I'll treat you to dinner.

649
22:45.000 --> 22:45.550
No.

650
22:46.350 --> 22:47.920
We're not going to a restaurant.

651
22:47.920 --> 22:48.750
Let's just find somewhere to sit,

652
22:48.750 --> 22:50.880
order some takeout, just the two of us.

653
22:51.720 --> 22:52.920
Then I want barbecue,

654
22:52.960 --> 22:54.490
the kind you had yesterday.

655
22:54.960 --> 22:56.620
Let's just have some skewers.

656
22:58.720 --> 23:00.680
Then I'll have a bowl of cold noodles,

657
23:00.680 --> 23:01.790
plus ten skewers.

658
23:01.790 --> 23:03.790
Make it 20. Pretty generous, right?

659
23:05.070 --> 23:05.640
Deal.

660
23:23.070 --> 23:24.110
I've known you for a few days now,

661
23:24.110 --> 23:26.640
and this is the first time I've seen you smile.

662
23:32.110 --> 23:33.000
You're young,

663
23:34.350 --> 23:35.750
you should smile more often.

664
23:35.750 --> 23:37.680
Don't look so serious all day long.

665
23:37.790 --> 23:38.850
When you get older,

666
23:39.590 --> 23:40.720
you won't have much expression on your face,

667
23:40.720 --> 23:42.580
and it'll be even harder to smile.

668
23:53.550 --> 23:54.400
Duan...

669
23:55.830 --> 23:57.240
used to be my neighbor.

670
23:58.310 --> 23:59.000
She became a workshop director

671
23:59.000 --> 24:00.240
at such a young age.

672
24:00.550 --> 24:02.080
She did things decisively.

673
24:03.110 --> 24:05.030
She had more backbone

674
24:05.590 --> 24:07.050
than many grown men I knew.

675
24:08.350 --> 24:09.880
She took good care of us too.

676
24:10.790 --> 24:12.960
Even now, people still speak highly of her,

677
24:12.960 --> 24:13.760
including me.

678
24:18.440 --> 24:20.640
It's a pity. The paper mill was rebuilt,

679
24:21.070 --> 24:22.880
and over a hundred workers were laid off.

680
24:22.880 --> 24:24.880
The principles she'd lived by all her life

681
24:24.880 --> 24:26.610
suddenly didn't work anymore.

682
24:27.000 --> 24:28.000
Her life

683
24:28.720 --> 24:30.160
got stuck in 1998.

684
24:41.030 --> 24:42.630
You came back from Shenzhen,

685
24:44.270 --> 24:46.530
so you must feel that contrast even more.

686
24:47.310 --> 24:50.110
The world outside is changing every day.

687
24:51.720 --> 24:53.030
But our city

688
24:53.680 --> 24:55.350
is getting older and older.

689
24:56.830 --> 24:59.030
Just like the older people around here,

690
24:59.720 --> 25:00.440
their way of thinking

691
25:00.440 --> 25:01.920
is stuck in the year 2000.

692
25:08.270 --> 25:10.070
What does that have to do with me?

693
25:10.350 --> 25:11.480
Isn't your family from here?

694
25:11.480 --> 25:13.680
No, I'm from Shenzhen.

695
25:16.440 --> 25:18.100
Quit putting on an act with me.

696
25:22.400 --> 25:24.000
You're done eating already?

697
25:24.440 --> 25:25.900
What about those skewers?

698
25:27.000 --> 25:27.640
I'm full.

699
25:28.270 --> 25:28.920
Leave them for those

700
25:28.920 --> 25:30.980
colleagues working the night shift.

701
25:31.590 --> 25:33.920
Roasted sweet potato. Don't you want one?

702
25:45.920 --> 25:46.830
What a waste.

703
25:48.960 --> 25:51.160
Playing the sympathy card didn't work.

704
25:53.900 --> 26:00.660
[Xiaoximen Hospital, the guardian of your health]

705
26:11.120 --> 26:15.870
[Emergency]

706
27:09.200 --> 27:10.030
You're awake.

707
27:12.000 --> 27:13.330
Why are you so careless?

708
27:13.720 --> 27:15.650
Don't you know your own condition?

709
27:19.240 --> 27:20.720
You silly child,

710
27:21.270 --> 27:23.130
making me feel worried every day.

711
27:29.680 --> 27:30.480
Come here.

712
27:37.640 --> 27:38.970
It's okay, Zhengliang.

713
27:39.030 --> 27:39.960
Mom is here.

714
27:40.160 --> 27:42.070
It's okay, son. It's okay.

715
27:44.510 --> 27:46.200
I'll make you some dumplings.

716
27:46.310 --> 27:47.000
Okay?

717
28:06.680 --> 28:07.720
What was that?

718
28:08.240 --> 28:10.240
I borrowed it from the kid next door.

719
28:14.200 --> 28:16.200
Who brought me here yesterday?

720
28:16.440 --> 28:17.240
Uncle Dong.

721
28:18.200 --> 28:19.750
Uncle Dong? Who is that?

722
28:20.310 --> 28:21.240
The president.

723
28:21.480 --> 28:22.790
His full name is Long Dongdong.

724
28:22.790 --> 28:23.850
You don't know him?

725
28:24.110 --> 28:25.680
What a funny name.

726
28:26.240 --> 28:27.110
Since when did you

727
28:27.110 --> 28:28.510
become a relative of his?

728
28:29.270 --> 28:30.200
Liu Zhengliang.

729
28:30.350 --> 28:31.070
At first,

730
28:31.110 --> 28:32.470
I thought you'd recovered a long time ago.

731
28:32.470 --> 28:34.000
I thought you were rushing back

732
28:34.000 --> 28:35.860
because you hated the Northeast.

733
28:35.880 --> 28:37.790
So it turns out you're still sick?

734
28:38.480 --> 28:39.680
Forget about Mom's situation.

735
28:39.680 --> 28:40.310
Leave it to me.

736
28:40.310 --> 28:41.550
Just peacefully

737
28:41.590 --> 28:43.190
get your ass back down South.

738
28:44.240 --> 28:45.510
I'd like to leave,

739
28:45.880 --> 28:47.240
but can I?

740
28:47.270 --> 28:49.000
I'll talk to Uncle Dong for you.

741
28:50.350 --> 28:51.200
No need.

742
28:51.790 --> 28:52.720
I'll handle

743
28:52.750 --> 28:54.080
my own business myself.

744
28:55.400 --> 28:56.240
Hello,

745
28:56.270 --> 28:57.680
everybody!

746
28:56.880 --> 28:58.280
[AC is On; Please keep the door closed]

747
28:58.310 --> 28:58.660
[Xiaoximen Hospital]

748
28:59.680 --> 29:00.750
Get well soon.

749
29:01.110 --> 29:01.840
Smells good?

750
29:03.200 --> 29:04.530
Why did you buy flowers?

751
29:04.960 --> 29:07.830
Well, staying in the hospital for a day is still a hospital stay.

752
29:07.830 --> 29:09.550
I couldn't show up empty-handed.

753
29:09.550 --> 29:10.160
Right?

754
29:11.160 --> 29:12.400
Hold on, Junnan.

755
29:12.720 --> 29:13.750
When you visited me a couple of days ago,

756
29:13.750 --> 29:14.590
you came empty-handed.

757
29:14.590 --> 29:15.750
He's only been here for one day,

758
29:15.750 --> 29:17.070
and I had a craniotomy.

759
29:17.110 --> 29:20.000
The difference in how we're being treated is insane!

760
29:20.000 --> 29:20.880
Are you seriously comparing my bond

761
29:20.880 --> 29:22.920
with you to my bond with your brother?

762
29:22.920 --> 29:23.680
When he and I

763
29:23.680 --> 29:24.640
were making mud pies and peeing

764
29:24.640 --> 29:25.480
by the roadside together as kids,

765
29:25.480 --> 29:26.880
what were you doing then?

766
29:27.310 --> 29:28.970
You were still a nursing baby!

767
29:40.590 --> 29:42.110
I shouldn't have brought this up.

768
29:42.110 --> 29:43.350
I miss my mom.

769
29:46.550 --> 29:48.070
Now you've made me sad.

770
29:48.550 --> 29:50.080
I shouldn't have said that.

771
29:50.720 --> 29:51.830
Don't take it to heart.

772
29:51.830 --> 29:52.560
Give me a hug.

773
29:54.480 --> 29:55.510
Alright, leave him alone.

774
29:55.510 --> 29:56.910
He'll be fine in a minute.

775
29:59.960 --> 30:00.640
Uncle Dong.

776
30:00.720 --> 30:01.380
Uncle Dong.

777
30:02.480 --> 30:03.480
Everyone's here.

778
30:05.070 --> 30:06.200
How are you feeling?

779
30:08.510 --> 30:10.440
Can we talk privately for a moment?

780
30:12.000 --> 30:12.640
Sure.

781
30:13.270 --> 30:14.670
Come downstairs with me.

782
30:19.430 --> 30:23.220
[Xiaoximen Hospital]

783
30:32.070 --> 30:33.240
Don't worry.

784
30:33.480 --> 30:34.790
I'll pay you back

785
30:34.880 --> 30:36.070
for last night's hospital stay.

786
30:36.070 --> 30:37.270
Just go to the cashier window

787
30:37.270 --> 30:38.730
and pay it there yourself.

788
30:45.000 --> 30:45.750
When you have time,

789
30:45.750 --> 30:46.920
stop by my office to

790
30:51.830 --> 30:54.290
finish the paperwork for your resignation.

791
30:57.160 --> 30:59.480
When you told me about your illness before,

792
30:59.480 --> 31:00.720
I was a bit skeptical.

793
31:01.830 --> 31:03.890
I didn't realize it was this serious.

794
31:05.070 --> 31:07.530
I never make things difficult for patients.

795
31:09.000 --> 31:11.730
And the Northeast really isn't the place for you.

796
31:15.270 --> 31:17.470
You're free to leave whenever you want.

797
31:24.160 --> 31:24.960
That's all.

798
31:43.160 --> 31:44.720
Sir, just pull over to the right.

799
31:44.030 --> 31:48.290
[Xiaoximen Hospital]

800
31:44.720 --> 31:46.000
Did you see that man waving?

801
31:46.000 --> 31:46.550
Right.

802
31:49.480 --> 31:50.070
Okay.

803
31:50.200 --> 31:50.830
There you are, sis.

804
31:50.830 --> 31:51.360
Hey, man.

805
31:51.590 --> 31:52.480
Hello, ma'am.

806
31:53.110 --> 31:54.070
-Mom, careful. -Sis.

807
31:54.070 --> 31:54.310
Go ahead.

808
31:54.310 --> 31:55.440
This is the last place we're looking at.

809
31:54.570 --> 31:58.870
[Fucheng City Taxi]

810
31:55.480 --> 31:56.720
But I'll be honest with you.

811
31:56.720 --> 31:57.030
I won't give you

812
31:57.030 --> 31:58.030
the runaround.

813
31:58.160 --> 31:58.920
This one

814
31:58.920 --> 31:59.830
really isn't as good as the two places

815
31:59.830 --> 32:00.720
we looked at near the No. 1 Hospital.

816
32:00.720 --> 32:01.510
How so?

817
32:01.550 --> 32:02.270
Look across the street.

818
32:02.270 --> 32:03.480
Isn't that Xiaoximen Hospital?

819
32:03.480 --> 32:04.240
There are fewer patients there.

820
32:04.240 --> 32:05.640
Fewer patients means less business.

821
32:05.640 --> 32:06.550
The two places near the No. 1 Hospital

822
32:06.550 --> 32:07.200
are much more sought-after.

823
32:07.200 --> 32:09.330
No one has even asked about this place.

824
32:09.510 --> 32:10.640
What about the rent?

825
32:11.350 --> 32:12.830
If you're on a tight budget,

826
32:12.830 --> 32:13.720
this place will do.

827
32:13.720 --> 32:14.070
But, sis,

828
32:14.070 --> 32:15.550
you don't look like you're short on money.

829
32:15.550 --> 32:16.230
That's true.

830
32:16.230 --> 32:16.640
Right?

831
32:16.640 --> 32:17.440
That's true.

832
32:17.640 --> 32:18.750
Shall we take a look at this one?

833
32:18.750 --> 32:20.000
Go ahead. Open it.

834
32:20.240 --> 32:21.030
Sure.

835
32:21.440 --> 32:23.440
This used to be a noodle shop, right?

836
32:30.000 --> 32:30.830
How long

837
32:30.830 --> 32:32.270
has this place been empty?

838
32:32.270 --> 32:33.130
Almost a month.

839
32:33.310 --> 32:34.270
The previous noodle shop

840
32:34.270 --> 32:35.200
closed down suddenly.

841
32:35.200 --> 32:36.330
They left in a hurry.

842
32:36.440 --> 32:38.000
Why did they close up the shop?

843
32:38.000 --> 32:39.200
Someone in the family got sick.

844
32:39.200 --> 32:40.510
The couple went back to their hometown.

845
32:39.530 --> 32:42.990
[Fucheng City Food Business Operator Information Disclosure Board]

846
32:41.000 --> 32:43.530
There's a decent amount of foot traffic here.

847
32:46.510 --> 32:48.240
There's nothing you can do about life and death.

848
32:48.240 --> 32:51.040
-Ai Chen. -This place gets good light, right, sis?

849
32:51.350 --> 32:54.010
It's nice that this bedroom gets a little light.

850
32:55.590 --> 32:56.750
I want to cross the street

851
32:56.750 --> 32:58.200
to see Zhengguang.

852
32:58.680 --> 32:59.790
Come on.

853
33:00.400 --> 33:02.200
You're bored again, aren't you?

854
33:02.510 --> 33:03.590
You know

855
33:03.680 --> 33:05.590
I'm not interested in your business.

856
33:05.590 --> 33:07.350
Of course I know.

857
33:07.350 --> 33:08.240
Go ahead.

858
33:08.240 --> 33:09.440
I'll be fine on my own.

859
33:14.480 --> 33:15.310
The ceiling height in there...

860
33:15.310 --> 33:17.720
isn't it a bit low?

861
33:19.240 --> 33:20.700
You call this ceiling low?

862
33:21.160 --> 33:23.020
What exactly are you looking for?

863
33:23.240 --> 33:25.480
How do I pay the rent each month?

864
33:26.160 --> 33:27.200
What's the payment structure for the rent and deposit?

865
33:27.200 --> 33:28.720
Is there a rent-free period?

866
33:28.720 --> 33:29.750
Sis, if money isn't an issue,

867
33:29.750 --> 33:30.480
you should rent one of those two places

868
33:30.480 --> 33:31.590
near the No. 1 Hospital.

869
33:31.590 --> 33:33.000
Here, the deposit is one month's rent, and you have to pay three months upfront.

870
33:33.000 --> 33:33.680
There is no rent-free period.

871
33:33.680 --> 33:34.480
The price is non-negotiable.

872
33:34.480 --> 33:35.160
A rat!

873
33:36.000 --> 33:36.590
Get lost.

874
33:41.000 --> 33:42.200
What's there to be afraid of?

875
33:42.200 --> 33:43.000
Well,

876
33:43.510 --> 33:45.170
I'm just scared of that thing.

877
33:45.550 --> 33:46.350
Hurry up.

878
33:46.750 --> 33:48.680
How much is the rent here, exactly?

879
34:01.030 --> 34:02.360
When are you going back?

880
34:04.750 --> 34:06.030
I'll buy a ticket as soon as I get home.

881
34:06.030 --> 34:07.510
I'll take whatever flight I can get.

882
34:07.510 --> 34:08.840
The sooner, the better.

883
34:10.880 --> 34:12.409
Do you have money to go back?

884
34:24.920 --> 34:25.710
Well,

885
34:26.070 --> 34:27.030
after paying your medical bills

886
34:27.030 --> 34:28.190
out of Mom's savings,

887
34:28.190 --> 34:29.230
there was a little left over.

888
34:29.230 --> 34:30.830
I'll use what's left for now.

889
34:31.110 --> 34:32.750
Once I'm back on my feet financially,

890
34:32.750 --> 34:33.750
I'll pay you back.

891
34:33.920 --> 34:34.710
No need.

892
34:35.360 --> 34:36.889
You have your share anyway.

893
34:37.800 --> 34:38.840
You little brat.

894
34:39.880 --> 34:40.760
Didn't you say

895
34:40.760 --> 34:42.690
I wasn't worthy of being Mom's son?

896
34:45.760 --> 34:47.150
I knew you're petty!

897
34:47.710 --> 34:48.550
I made one comment,

898
34:48.550 --> 34:50.679
and you'll hold it against me for life.

899
34:53.400 --> 34:54.070
Aunt Mi?

900
34:55.190 --> 34:56.000
Zhengguang.

901
34:56.070 --> 34:56.880
No way.

902
34:58.760 --> 34:59.920
When did you get out?

903
34:59.920 --> 35:01.380
The day before yesterday.

904
35:01.920 --> 35:02.880
I went to the police station yesterday

905
35:02.880 --> 35:03.800
to sort something out.

906
35:03.800 --> 35:04.590
Otherwise,

907
35:04.710 --> 35:06.570
I would've come to see you sooner.

908
35:08.280 --> 35:11.000
I've heard your mom's situation.

909
35:12.440 --> 35:13.970
Haven't they found her yet?

910
35:14.000 --> 35:15.760
We still don't know what happened to her.

911
35:15.760 --> 35:16.890
When you get better,

912
35:16.920 --> 35:18.030
I'll go look for her with you.

913
35:18.030 --> 35:18.840
Okay.

914
35:19.280 --> 35:20.590
Liu Zhengguang, I'm leaving.

915
35:20.150 --> 35:25.350
[Non-Smoking Ward]

916
35:21.320 --> 35:22.180
It's Aunt Mi Si.

917
35:22.510 --> 35:24.110
She's a good friend of Mom's.

918
35:27.480 --> 35:29.510
That's my older brother, Liu Zhengliang.

919
35:29.510 --> 35:31.370
He's arrogant and has no manners.

920
35:31.400 --> 35:32.660
Please don't mind him.

921
35:32.840 --> 35:34.840
I've heard your mother mention him.

922
35:35.030 --> 35:35.880
He's afraid of snow.

923
35:35.880 --> 35:36.710
Yes.

924
35:36.960 --> 35:39.560
He's going back to Shenzhen in a couple of days.

925
35:39.630 --> 35:41.320
To me, that means he'll be gone for good.

926
35:41.320 --> 35:42.450
Just don't mind him.

927
35:42.710 --> 35:43.590
Are you doing well?

928
35:43.590 --> 35:44.320
Pretty good.

929
35:44.510 --> 35:45.150
Auntie.

930
35:45.710 --> 35:47.630
Why did you come to visit me empty-handed, too?

931
35:47.630 --> 35:48.840
How's that possible?

932
35:58.000 --> 35:59.590
I'm not a kid anymore.

933
35:59.630 --> 36:01.490
If you don't like it, give it to me.

934
36:02.230 --> 36:03.030
I like it.

935
36:03.550 --> 36:04.880
It's nice to put it here.

936
36:06.360 --> 36:10.490
[Shop for Rent]

937
36:06.400 --> 36:08.440
Sis, you really don't like any of these places?

938
36:08.440 --> 36:09.360
No rush.

939
36:09.480 --> 36:10.840
I'll go home and think it over.

940
36:10.840 --> 36:12.110
We exchanged numbers, didn't we?

941
36:12.110 --> 36:13.070
Then I'll wait for your call.

942
36:13.070 --> 36:13.920
Okay. Thanks, buddy.

943
36:13.920 --> 36:14.760
It's a hot property.

944
36:14.760 --> 36:15.550
I know.

945
36:21.790 --> 36:24.240
[107 Xiaoximen Hospital] [553 Xiaoximen Hospital]

946
36:40.670 --> 36:41.510
Oh no.

947
36:41.510 --> 36:42.320
Oh no, no, no.

948
36:42.320 --> 36:43.710
Jiao!

949
36:44.030 --> 36:45.280
Girl?

950
36:45.670 --> 36:46.600
Come on. Come on.

951
36:47.070 --> 36:48.510
I didn't see them!

952
36:48.510 --> 36:49.400
My daughter!

953
36:49.480 --> 36:50.230
Let's get you to the hospital.

954
36:50.230 --> 36:50.880
My daughter!

955
36:50.880 --> 36:52.080
It's okay. It's okay.

956
36:52.320 --> 36:54.930
[107 Xiaoximen Hospital]

957
36:54.280 --> 36:55.110
Hang in there.

958
36:55.710 --> 36:56.360
Kid.

959
36:56.360 --> 36:57.000
Come on.

960
36:57.000 --> 36:58.550
Open the door! Hurry!

961
36:58.550 --> 36:59.320
Open it!

962
37:02.360 --> 37:03.440
Emergency! Emergency!

963
37:03.440 --> 37:04.100
Go that way!

964
37:16.230 --> 37:17.960
I heard you couldn't open this door.

965
37:17.960 --> 37:19.510
Dr. Che insisted I get the door fixed.

966
37:19.510 --> 37:20.280
No need.

967
37:20.320 --> 37:21.110
Look.

968
37:21.150 --> 37:21.960
Dr. Liu.

969
37:22.150 --> 37:23.150
I heard from the president

970
37:23.150 --> 37:24.480
that you're resigning.

971
37:25.070 --> 37:27.600
I'm going upstairs to sign the paperwork now.

972
37:27.630 --> 37:29.590
Why are you leaving without saying anything?

973
37:29.590 --> 37:31.480
There was no need. We're not close.

974
37:31.480 --> 37:32.880
Dr. Che, we have a patient from a car accident.

975
37:32.880 --> 37:33.840
Please go take a look.

976
37:33.840 --> 37:34.630
Coming.

977
37:38.440 --> 37:39.630
Go inside!

978
37:39.630 --> 37:40.110
Doctor!

979
37:40.110 --> 37:40.800
Is there a stretcher?

980
37:40.800 --> 37:42.600
-Doctor! -Is there a stretcher?

981
37:42.630 --> 37:43.760
Get a stretcher! Get a stretcher!

982
37:43.760 --> 37:44.800
Doctor.

983
37:45.150 --> 37:46.070
What happened?

984
37:46.630 --> 37:47.710
She was hit by a car.

985
37:48.510 --> 37:49.280
She got run over by a car.

986
37:49.280 --> 37:49.880
Jiao.

987
37:51.000 --> 37:53.280
-Slow down. -My Jiao.

988
37:53.960 --> 37:55.510
Slow down.

989
37:56.190 --> 37:57.000
Let's go.

990
37:56.700 --> 37:57.780
[Chest Pain is Preferenced]

991
37:57.880 --> 37:58.670
Jiao.

992
37:59.360 --> 38:00.190
Careful.

993
38:02.840 --> 38:03.480
Huang.

994
38:03.480 --> 38:04.960
What's wrong with him?

995
38:05.070 --> 38:06.110
He faints at the sight of blood.

996
38:06.110 --> 38:07.630
He faints at the sight of blood?

997
38:07.630 --> 38:09.630
What kind of doctor faints at blood?

998
38:11.510 --> 38:12.230
Let me in.

999
38:12.920 --> 38:14.550
Get the patient's family out of the room.

1000
38:14.550 --> 38:15.630
Come on, ma'am.

1001
38:15.630 --> 38:16.630
Ma'am, come here.

1002
38:19.960 --> 38:21.490
Let's wait outside for now.

1003
38:35.440 --> 38:36.440
We're trying to resuscitate the child.

1004
38:36.440 --> 38:37.110
We need to cut her clothes off.

1005
38:37.110 --> 38:38.310
Is that okay with you?

1006
38:38.440 --> 38:39.440
Yes, that's fine.

1007
38:43.510 --> 38:44.280
Zhang Jiao.

1008
38:44.510 --> 38:45.280
Zhang Jiao.

1009
38:50.630 --> 38:52.110
Laceration of the left temporal scalp

1010
38:52.110 --> 38:53.240
with exposed skull.

1011
38:53.590 --> 38:55.390
Severe bleeding from the wound.

1012
38:55.400 --> 38:57.660
Suspected open traumatic brain injury.

1013
38:59.130 --> 39:02.580
[Priority Care for Acute Stroke]

1014
39:01.440 --> 39:02.970
Fracture of the left thigh.

1015
39:03.480 --> 39:05.010
Abrasions on the lower leg.

1016
39:06.800 --> 39:07.880
Blood pressure is 60 over 40.

1017
39:07.880 --> 39:09.150
Heart rate is 154 beats per minute.

1018
39:09.150 --> 39:10.350
Establish IV access.

1019
39:10.400 --> 39:11.480
Give fluids to raise her blood pressure,

1020
39:11.480 --> 39:12.340
vasopressors,

1021
39:12.400 --> 39:13.760
100 mg dopamine,

1022
39:14.480 --> 39:15.480
250 mL saline,

1023
39:15.480 --> 39:16.140
and IV drip.

1024
39:16.150 --> 39:16.710
Got it.

1025
39:17.230 --> 39:18.030
Monitor her blood pressure.

1026
39:18.030 --> 39:18.590
Prepare mannitol.

1027
39:18.590 --> 39:19.960
You all saw what happened.

1028
39:19.960 --> 39:22.110
They fell onto the road first.

1029
39:22.440 --> 39:23.440
Stop talking.

1030
39:24.000 --> 39:24.590
Can't you see

1031
39:24.590 --> 39:25.510
what condition the child is in?

1032
39:25.510 --> 39:26.840
Ma'am, please make way.

1033
39:28.150 --> 39:28.810
This is bad.

1034
39:29.280 --> 39:30.740
Her left pupil is dilated.

1035
39:32.150 --> 39:33.840
Could this be brain herniation?

1036
39:33.840 --> 39:34.590
Her oxygen saturation is 85%.

1037
39:34.590 --> 39:35.670
And it's still dropping.

1038
39:35.670 --> 39:36.530
I'll take over.

1039
39:37.630 --> 39:38.290
Zhang Jiao.

1040
39:43.840 --> 39:45.320
She's going into respiratory failure.

1041
39:45.320 --> 39:46.280
Call Anesthesiology.

1042
39:46.280 --> 39:47.680
Prepare for intubation.

1043
39:47.710 --> 39:49.040
Put her on a ventilator.

1044
39:54.800 --> 39:55.590
Flashlight.

1045
39:57.000 --> 39:58.130
No, there's no time.

1046
39:58.150 --> 39:59.880
It'll take time for the anesthesiology team to get here.

1047
39:59.880 --> 40:00.840
Brain herniation is extremely dangerous.

1048
40:00.840 --> 40:02.480
Her condition could deteriorate rapidly.

1049
40:02.480 --> 40:03.710
The patient is already showing

1050
40:03.710 --> 40:05.110
signs of respiratory failure.

1051
40:05.110 --> 40:06.510
If we don't act quickly,

1052
40:06.710 --> 40:08.110
she could die at any moment.

1053
40:08.110 --> 40:08.550
We must

1054
40:08.550 --> 40:09.710
get a CT scan immediately

1055
40:09.710 --> 40:11.360
to see what's happening in her brain.

1056
40:11.360 --> 40:12.480
Get me a bag-valve mask, now!

1057
40:12.480 --> 40:13.190
Here, here.

1058
40:13.320 --> 40:14.110
Move her to the CT room

1059
40:14.110 --> 40:14.880
for a scan.

1060
40:17.630 --> 40:18.440
Are you ready?

1061
40:18.440 --> 40:18.840
Ready.

1062
40:21.030 --> 40:22.360
Ma'am, please make way.

1063
40:24.660 --> 40:29.650
[Medication Pick-up] [Prescription Review]

1064
40:29.910 --> 40:37.420
[Please keep the room clean]

1065
40:47.160 --> 40:50.340
[Please keep the room clean]

1066
40:55.800 --> 40:56.800
Mom, what's up?

1067
40:57.280 --> 40:58.880
Are you still house hunting?

1068
40:58.960 --> 41:00.110
No, I've stopped looking.

1069
41:00.110 --> 41:01.880
I'm on the first floor in the ER.

1070
41:01.920 --> 41:03.110
Something awful just happened.

1071
41:03.110 --> 41:05.770
I walked outside and came across a car accident.

1072
41:05.800 --> 41:07.320
That girl was hit so badly,

1073
41:07.320 --> 41:09.280
I thought her brains were coming out.

1074
41:09.280 --> 41:10.940
I carried her to the hospital.

1075
41:13.230 --> 41:14.630
Can they save her?

1076
41:15.510 --> 41:17.030
I don't think she has much of a chance.

1077
41:17.030 --> 41:18.230
How can they save her?

1078
41:20.880 --> 41:22.760
Multiple fractures of the left side of the skull,

1079
41:22.760 --> 41:24.880
extensive cerebral contusions and lacerations

1080
41:24.880 --> 41:27.030
with subdural and intracerebral hematomas.

1081
41:27.030 --> 41:28.030
An estimated

1082
41:28.030 --> 41:29.710
blood volume of over 90 mL.

1083
41:30.190 --> 41:32.050
And the midline shift is over 2 cm.

1084
41:34.000 --> 41:35.060
Brain herniation.

1085
41:36.760 --> 41:37.920
There's no hope.

1086
41:38.590 --> 41:39.800
Notify the family.

1087
41:41.400 --> 41:43.110
Surgery might still save her.

1088
41:44.630 --> 41:45.480
Look at the scan—

1089
41:45.480 --> 41:46.760
her brain's severely damaged.

1090
41:46.760 --> 41:48.360
It looks like crumbled tofu.

1091
41:48.590 --> 41:51.320
How can we save her if her brain has been shattered like this?

1092
41:51.320 --> 41:51.590
That means without surgery,

1093
41:51.590 --> 41:53.250
she'll almost certainly die.

1094
41:53.280 --> 41:54.710
Surgery can give her a slim chance of survival!

1095
41:54.710 --> 41:56.000
Easy for you to say.

1096
41:56.070 --> 41:57.590
Who at Xiaoximen Hospital could perform this surgery?

1097
41:57.590 --> 41:58.880
Even Director Tong couldn't do it,

1098
41:58.880 --> 42:00.110
let alone us.

1099
42:00.110 --> 42:01.150
Can you do it, can I do it,

1100
42:01.150 --> 42:01.960
or can Dr. Yang do it?

1101
42:01.960 --> 42:02.670
He can!

1102
42:05.180 --> 42:12.440
[Priority Care for Acute Stroke]

1103
42:09.150 --> 42:09.960
Dr. Liu.

1104
42:11.030 --> 42:12.030
I saw you

1105
42:12.030 --> 42:14.160
operate on your brother the other day.

1106
42:14.480 --> 42:15.710
You're so skilled.

1107
42:16.150 --> 42:17.590
Can you save this child?

1108
42:19.280 --> 42:20.800
Given her condition,

1109
42:20.960 --> 42:23.020
the surgery is extremely difficult.

1110
42:24.110 --> 42:26.110
Even if my mentor performed the surgery,

1111
42:26.110 --> 42:27.840
he might not be able to save her.

1112
42:33.510 --> 42:34.320
Then...

1113
42:35.400 --> 42:36.110
we can't just

1114
42:36.110 --> 42:36.960
stand by and watch

1115
42:36.960 --> 42:38.190
her die, can we?

1116
42:41.360 --> 42:42.030
Enough.

1117
42:42.190 --> 42:43.790
Don't put Dr. Liu on the spot.

1118
42:43.840 --> 42:45.440
He doesn't even work here anymore.

1119
42:45.440 --> 42:47.640
Why are you dragging him into this mess?

1120
42:52.230 --> 42:53.550
Are you afraid her family will

1121
42:53.550 --> 42:55.070
cause trouble if you fail to save her?

1122
42:55.070 --> 42:56.000
I'll go talk to them.

1123
42:56.000 --> 42:58.060
You just need to focus on the surgery.

1124
42:58.360 --> 42:59.550
Let's take a gamble,

1125
42:59.840 --> 43:00.630
okay?

1126
43:12.360 --> 43:13.110
I can't take that risk.
